<Solution>
  <!-- JustBetweenUs.WithAndroid.slnx
       The Android solution: everything in JustBetweenUs.slnx PLUS the Android head and the
       .Android twin of Core, which need the .NET Android workload.
       Open JustBetweenUs.slnx instead if you only have the plain .NET SDK. -->
